{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2022-12-07 16:15:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CORK, IRELAND , DEC. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF JOHNSON CONTROLS INTERNATIONAL PLC (NYSE: JCI) APPROVED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.35\xa0PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE ON JAN. 13, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DEC. 19, 2022. JOHNSON CONTROLS HAS PAID A CONSECUTIVE DIVIDEND SINCE 1887.'}